o","id":999476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5OTQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/999476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo","html_url":"https://github.com/ZanQdo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZanQdo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/5200343","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/1647#issuecomment-5200343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/1647","id":5200343,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyMDAzNDM=","user":{"login":"alteredq","id":438022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/438022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq","html_url":"https://github.com/alteredq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-04-18T14:50:00Z","updated_at":"2012-04-18T14:50:00Z","body":"I don't know what to do about this, there were tons of changes since r43 :S\n\nIt's possible we are hitting issues I mentioned in the first comment. \n\nSeams in normal mapped models are very common problem and as far as I understood the only solution is to have very tight pipeline where what's happening on the model creation side is exactly mirrored on the shading side (tangent spaces and quad tessellations must match). \n\nWhich is kinda hard to achieve for application like yours where models can come from anywhere.\n\nThe other \"solution\" what games tend to do is simply to hide UV seams in less noticeable places, which is also something you can't do.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/5200343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alteredq","id":438022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODAyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/438022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq","html_url":"https://github.com/alteredq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alteredq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/7996741","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/1647#issuecomment-7996741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/1647","id":7996741,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc5OTY3NDE=","user":{"login":"SHVV","id":951742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTc0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/951742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV","html_url":"https://github.com/SHVV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2012-08-24T09:32:05Z","updated_at":"2012-08-24T10:46:15Z","body":"I've also faced with this issue and solved it.\n\nLooks like there is a problem with shared vertices on UV seams. In geometry it is one vertex with one position and one normal, but in UV space it must be two (or more) vertices. So, when tangent is computed in this vertex, three.js adds up completely different tangents into one and gets strong visible seam.\n\nTo solve this problem, I've split geometry into parts by UV seams (function geometry_splitByUV in example), and they are gone, because after this, each vertex with different position/normal/UV has its own unique tangent.\n\nSee this in action:\nOriginal: \nhttps://dl.dropbox.com/u/5549473/three.js/rock_seam.jpg\nhttps://dl.dropbox.com/u/5549473/AIM/rock1_seam.xhtml\n\nAfter fix: \nhttps://dl.dropbox.com/u/5549473/three.js/rock.jpg\nhttps://dl.dropbox.com/u/5549473/AIM/rock1.xhtml\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/7996741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SHVV","id":951742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MTc0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/951742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV","html_url":"https://github.com/SHVV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SHVV/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":30664668,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDMwNjY0NjY4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/events/30664668","actor":{"login":"wvl","id":387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wvl","html_url":"https://github.com/wvl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wvl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wvl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wvl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wvl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions